# feat-068 — `playwright` (not `playwright-core`) runs a postinstall that downloads three browser
# binaries. Vercel's install step is `npm ci`, which installs devDependencies, so without this every
# production build would spend minutes fetching browsers it never launches. The e2e gates that DO
# need them run locally / in the AFK harness, where `npx playwright install` is explicit.
playwright_skip_browser_download=1
